    {
      "body": "Thanks for looking into this! My fix for #47613 has now been merged into main via #47614.\n\nThe merged fix records the received proxy tensors on `self.forward_stream` in `_pp_launch_batch`, before `run_batch`, to prevent premature allocator reuse. Since both PRs address the same lifetime race, this PR appears to be superseded by #47614.",
